			"language": "en",
			"displayName": "My File Archive - Internet Archive Integration",
			"description": "Unlimited space, unlimited files...\nWorking in integration with the Internet Archive system—a digital online file storage archive—this add-on enables NVDA users to store all their files in an organized manner, download them whenever desired, or create sharing links. It facilitates archive management by making all frequently used operations accessible via keyboard shortcuts.\n(NVDA+Alt+A)"
		},
		{
